                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Well. Lets see. \n\nNo score, no mention of what level you are on. No time limit. When youre given a new gun, no mention of how to equip it. \n\nAll the levels are completely repetitve, and offer zero visual variety within the world. If you are in the forest world, its going to look like the forest. Same trees, same enemies, barely any platforming. They seem to go on forever. \n\nYou collect meat, because you need 100 to continue. They start you with 500. None of this is explained till you die. \n\nThe loading screen tells you to go on YouTube to learn how to defeat the bosses. Heres a hint, Mash the fire button. \n\nSpeaking of the fire button. Defaults to shift. Change it immediately otherwise you will have sticky keys issues. \n\nTo recap:\n\nI dont know what lvl I am on, I dont have a score, I dont have a time limit, I dont have creative and fun levels. \n\nWhy am I playing?",
